# Applies to builds of docker/web_application/web_application.Dockerfile
# (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the Dockerfile). The root
# .dockerignore excludes node_modules and .next at the root only, and nothing
# excludes web_application/.env.local, which holds upstream's super-admin
# token in development; the release image must carry none of them.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.local.example
api
e2e
perf
docs
deploy
docker/api
docker/tooling
docker/learning-center-mock
docker/oidc
.github
*.md
